{"articleNo":"542764","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=542764&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] 2025년 (재)구미시장학재단 '지역대학-지역 내 취창업 연계 장학생' 선발 안내","writer":"학생성공과","writeDate":"2025.11.06","hit":"4539","attachments":[{"name":"(공고문) 2025년도 구미시장학재단 「지역대학-지역 내 취ㆍ창업 연계 장학생」 선발 공고.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=542764&attachNo=158720"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\">▣ 구미시 우수인재의 지역 내 취창업 및 정착을 지원하기 위해 2025년 (재)구미시장학재단&nbsp;'지역대학-지역 내 취창업 연계 장학생'을</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\">아래와 같이 선발하오니 관심있는 졸업자의 많은 신청 바랍니다.</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 18.2pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -18.2pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt;\">신청기간&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">2025. 11. 10.(월)</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;09:00 ~ 11. 21.(금</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">) 18:00 [12</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">일간</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">]</span></u></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 102.3pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -102.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt;\">지원대상&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt;\">구미시 소재 대학교 졸업자 중</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt;\">관내 중소</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt;\">중견기업에&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt;\">개월 이상 재직 중이거나 관내 창업 유지 중인 34세 이하인 자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 18.2pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -18.2pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt;\">선발규모&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;<b>80</b></span><b><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt;\">명</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt;\"> 선발&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">/ 1</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt;\">인당&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">150</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt;\">만원 지급</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 18.2pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -18.2pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt;\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt;\">신청방법&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 12pt;\">온라인 또는 방문 접수&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 11pt;\">토</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">·</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 11pt;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">·</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 11pt;\">공휴일 제외</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 11pt;\">평일 점심시간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(12~13</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 11pt;\">시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-family: 돋움체; font-size: 11pt;\">제외</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 18.2pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -18.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -18.2pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">&nbsp;(온라인</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -18.2pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -18.2pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">구미시장학재단 홈페이지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -18.2pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(www.gumigh.or.kr)</span></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"11976\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></div><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 18.2pt; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33,